<title>JAPAN: LTCB sees appraisal loss at Y256 bln at end-96/97.</title>
<headline>LTCB sees appraisal loss at Y256 bln at end-96/97.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Long-Term Credit Bank of Japan Ltd (LTCB) announced on Monday that it posted an appraisal loss of 256 billion yen on its securities holdings at the end of the 1996/97 financial year.</p>
</text>
